==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
A reference to the dairy cow, which once acquired may be milked on an ongoing basis.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[cash]] [[cow]]}}
# {{idiom}} A [[product]], [[service]], or [[business]] that generates ongoing, high [[profit]] compared to its cost; a [[moneymaker]].
#:''DVD versions of old movies are presumably major '''cash cows''' for the companies that own them.''

